there's a hill on the left with... Let me re-read the image: There's a hill at left-center, and a brown small figure at ~(120,200) which could be Mario standing on the hill? Actually Mario is small and red. The figure at (120,200) looks brownish. Hmm.\n\nLet me just take tools to determine state: read game_mode $0770, player position.\n\nActually, the screenshot shows what appears to be Mario on the hill — wait no. Let me look: at (120,200) there's a small figure that looks like Mario (red hat). The hill is behind. The ground bricks at the bottom. There's a Goomba? Hmm.\n\nLet me get concrete. I'll pause, read game mode, player pos.\n\nNote: current emulator status RUNNING.\n\nPlan:\n1. Pause, check game_mode and player position.\n2. If in a level, save_state as checkpoint.\n3. Play forward to find the Koopa Troopa.\n\nBut first, is the task's premise that we're at title/attract? The prompt says \"it is on its title screen or attract demo\". But screenshot shows a level. So we're mid-game from a previous session. Let's verify.\n\nLet me call get_cpu_state? No, read memory for $0770 and player position.\n\nLet me pause and read."}
