oopa Troopas? Hmm.\n\nHmm, wait, actually maybe the extra byte in the 3-byte entry is a \"page\" or the type is different.\n\nYou know what, the empirical approach will settle it: let me just play and look. Goomba type = 6. Let me watch for a type change to something else (2, 0x37, 0). ","truncated":true}
